      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'upstream/main' into issue/902-document-units\n\nConflicts: fanuc.cps / doosan-dnm.cps tilt() take main's angleWord call\nsites, and angleWord writes degrees (wa), never the unit-aware length\nword; mcp registry and posting.rs module list keep both sides;\nposting_per_op.rs drops the unused imports.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
