      "message": "test(post): the inch Tormach G96 pin makes its program inch through the document unit\n\nlathe_post_css::an_inch_tormach_posts_vc_in_ft_per_min_and_d_in_rpm (#1173,\nnew on main) made the program inch with an inch machine file, which #902's\nlaw no longer does. It now sets the document's unit to inch, and the file's\npost helper passes posting::program_options. The other nine tests are\nunchanged. Taken from e528c79c (carried by #1126).\n\nRefs #902\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
